取：请于</span><span style="color: #EE0000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">10月25日上午11：30-12：00至教学处（1114）</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">领取布置所需的物资，每个考场：座位贴1份、牛皮纸2张。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2.笔试试场布置环境要求：</span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="color: #FF0000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>地面清</strong></span><span style="color: #FF0000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">：</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">搞好教室卫生，地上无纸屑。</span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="color: #FF0000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>墙面清</strong></span><span style="color: #FF0000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">：</span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0.80in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: -0.50in;"><span style="color: #FF0000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-indent: 0;width: 0.500in;">（1）</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">墙上所有</span><span style="color: #FF0000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>文字和图画</strong></span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">都要清除，实在无法清除的用厚纸覆盖，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>覆盖要牢固、整齐</strong></span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。覆盖的纸到教学处（家贤楼1114）领取。</span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0.80in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: -0.50in;"><span style="color: #FF0000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-indent: 0;width: 0.500in;">（2）</span><span style="color: #FF0000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>软板</strong></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">帘子拉下，教室内的</span><span style="color: #FF0000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>时钟</strong></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">全部摘下，放在讲台上，供监考教师参考。</span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0.80in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: -0.50in;"><span style="color: #FF0000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-indent: 0;width: 0.500in;">（3）</span><span style="color: #FF0000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>黑板</strong></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">用水擦干净。</span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="color: #FF0000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>桌面清</strong></span><span style="color: #FF0000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">：</span><span style="color: #FF0000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>桌面</strong></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">要求无任何图文</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，挑选桌面平整的，</span><span style="color: #FF0000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>桌脚</strong></span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">不摇晃课桌做考试课桌。桌椅高度统一调整为左右两侧各露出三个孔。</span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="color: #333333;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2025\10\202510241620141543.Png" style="width: 5.398611in; height: 3.7125in" alt="202510241620143618.Png" /></span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="color: #FF0000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>桌内、椅兜清</strong></span><span style="color: #FF0000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">：</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">课桌内、课桌下、椅兜清理干净。</span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="color: #FF0000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>柜内清：</strong></span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0.31in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.00in;"><span style="color: #FF0000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-indent: 0;width: 0.278in;"><strong>（1）</strong></span><span style="color: #333333;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">教室南面和后面的柜子以及放保洁用品的柜子可以放</span><span style="color: #333333;font-family: 